# Frozen paper dataset — canonical substrate (see data/DATASET.md).
# 96MB SQLite binary holding the full private graph — pointer is tracked, DB is not.
# The frozen paper snapshots hold private, identity-bearing graph content and are
# never committed. Match the whole SQLite FAMILY, not just the .db extension: the
# -wal and -shm sidecars were committed once because `data/*.db` does not match
# them, and a -wal can carry un-checkpointed page data even when the .db is ignored.
data/*.db*
bibliography/sources/agm_1985_partial_meet.pdf
bibliography/sources/alchourron_makinson_1982_theoria.pdf
